# User Welpy-cw <58345540+Welpy-cw@users.noreply.github.com>
# Date 1793907143 -7200
# Node ID 512e24afbcf0edfa7d98c14a2da18a01e6d2a47d
# Parent  a68d837299ee9f10efbc89467a707c3a98df250b
Bug 1847432 - Refresh command state when the command context changes. r=mkmelin

Refresh mail and calendar command sets after tab selection, active mail-tab
loading, and Account Hub closure using a shared command-context-changed
update. Guard folder-pane readiness during startup and document command
updates.

Update New Message when account identities are added or accounts are removed,
and refresh tag commands when opening the Tag popup.

Add regression coverage for tab changes and loading, Quick Filter keyboard
focus, first-account setup and identity changes, and Tag popup actions.

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336765

